      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, you said some people were \"skeptical about the vaccines themselves.\" was that mostly because they were just being anti-science or were there actual legitimate medical or legal concerns being raised at the time? trying to figure out if the opposition was based on facts or just misinformation.",
